.TH tuical n 0.31.0 tclutils "Tcl Utility Library"
.SH NAME
tclutils::tuical \- iCalendar (RFC 5545) reader/writer
.SH SYNOPSIS
package require tclutils::tuical
.SH DESCRIPTION
Parses iCalendar text into a component tree and serializes it back with proper
line folding. See docs/tuical.md.
.SH KEYWORDS
icalendar, ics, calendar, parser
